dn.fastly.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/items/1551360/63a8558394335f3fd90a25cd5e0b1cb2740e555c.jpg","strMarketHash":"1551360-Horizon Canyon Train","nOwned":0},{"strName":"Horizon Watercraft Stunt Team","strTitle":"Horizon Watercraft Stunt Team","strImgURL":"https://community.fastly.steamstatic.com/economy/image/IzMF03bk9WpSBq-S-ekoE33L-iLqGFHVaU25ZzQNQcXdA3g5gMEPvUZZEfSMJ6dESN8p_2SVTY7V2NgKwXIPnj4QPivs0XEwTep-MdHJzk7MoPaIDnflaTHQZBLNCVB8VtcLZDXPp270sriZQT2aQ-F-FghXfKBS-mdJPpiJa0Bs048D-Da-kUYrGEF8c5wVJVu5mDoDP7pjyi4AIc4Q9n2td8OMiA1kORNiUuruArjCaIf2kShxWRw2HvQdN4LB7nbtq5_3O_-DLas_MPEp78uAkUBPHdBwq-m2","strArtworkURL":"https://cdn.fastly.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/items/1551360/433f5e64d03d38d7b8ddc6d8723bdbfc350ab379.jpg","strMarketHash":"1551360-Horizon Watercraft Stunt Team","nOwned":0},{"strName":"1963 Volkswagen Beetle","strTitle":"1963 Volkswagen Beetle","strImgURL":"https://community.fastly.steamstatic.com/economy/image/IzMF03bk9WpSBq-S-ekoE33L-iLqGFHVaU25ZzQNQcXdA3g5gMEPvUZZEfSMJ6dESN8p_2SVTY7V2NgKwXIPnj4QPivs0XEwNLw6a4DwzwnwsvWMG3H5IxXBKjXVGRhhEOIJYGXb_zvx5bmcRTnLQr15RgxQfKoHo2UfOJrdbRE63NFYrjzszkYtTk96PNVId0m5xWYXNK8awSwTIs5fyyKhc5zR11Y2bEZtXOvmUenGadCkxCh3VE4xTKFJbI3EsCDsq5-launGc68hIvw1guAMRwM","strArtworkURL":"https://cdn.fastly.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/items/1551360/4c558df796984e78c2284f45ee9cd8e3c3361a02.jpg","strMarketHash":"1551360-1963 Volkswagen Beetle","nOwned":0}]}}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Playground Games","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/developer/XboxGameStudios"}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"Xbox Game Studios","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/XboxGameStudios"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"Forza","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/Forza"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"您的終極 Horizon 冒險正等著您展開！探索墨西哥充滿活力且不斷變化的開放世界景色，駕駛百輛世界級好車，享受無拘無束又有趣的駕駛體驗。\r\n\r\n這是您的 Horizon 冒險\r\n在墨西哥充滿活力並不斷變化的開放世界景色中，駕駛百輛世界級好車，享受無拘無束又有趣的駕駛體驗，並開始令人屏息的探險。\r\n\r\n這是多元化的開放世界\r\n探索景色反差懸殊、美麗無比的世界。發掘充滿生氣的沙漠、茂密的叢林、充滿歷史的城市、隱藏的廢墟、原始的海灘、廣大的峽谷和終年積雪的高聳火山。\r\n\r\n這是充滿冒險的開放世界\r\n讓自己沉浸在充滿百種挑戰的深度劇情，並以從事自己喜愛的活動作為獎勵。認識全新的角色，並為這些角色的 Horizon 故事任務選擇結局。\r\n\r\n這是不斷變化的開放世界\r\n挑戰墨西哥獨一無二、令人驚艷不已的氣候賽事，從高聳的沙塵暴到劇烈的熱帶風暴賽事，不斷變化的季節每週都將改變這個世界。持續回來遊戲，以享受全新賽事、挑戰、收藏品、獎勵，以及可供探險的全新區域。每個季節都有著自己獨特的美。\r\n\r\n這是社交開放世界 \r\n和其他玩家組隊，並加入 Horizon 過關挑戰賽享受一連串的樂趣，讓您和好友不斷進行挑戰，無需選單、下載畫面或大廳就可以玩得開心。在 Horizon 公開賽和巡迴賽中認識新好友，並利用新的社群禮物分享功能分享您的創作。\r\n\r\n這是您的開放世界\r\n利用強大的全新 EventLab 遊戲工具組展現自己對樂趣的想法，其中包含自訂比賽、挑戰、特技賽和全新的遊戲模式。全新選項可讓您以前所未有的方式來改裝您的車輛，如可以開啟和關閉的敞篷、塗裝剎車卡鉗，以及更多功能。使用全新禮物掉落箱功能，來和社群分享您設計的創作。\r\n\r\n立即展開您的 Horizon 冒險吧！","strSnippet":"在墨西哥充滿活力的開放世界景觀中探索，駕駛世界上最棒的汽車，享受無限樂趣的駕駛體驗。"}}],["achievementmap",{"version":5,"data":"[[1551360,[[\"ACHIEVEMENT_152\",{\"strName\":\"進入領域\",\"strDescription\":\"在自由模式或技能模式中進入任何領域\",\"strImage\":\"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1551360/d4645e480bc4178e713e33c602b14527b475abbf.jpg\",\"flAchieved\":6.800000190734863,\"strID\":\"ACHIEVEMENT_152\"}],[\"ACHIEVEMENT_46\",{\"strName\":\"長遠目標\",\"strDescription\":\"贏得 Goliath 賽事\",\"strImage\":\"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1551360/1e11a0239aac2fbc338d0b1e57be10c2ddc865d8.jpg\",\"flAchieved\":29.5,\"strID\":\"ACHIEVEMENT_46\"}],[\"ACHIEVEMENT_86\",{\"strName\":\"榮譽獎章\",\"strDescription\":\"已獲得 1 枚獎章\",\"strImage\":\"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1551360/b6f96178a207ff26098b32f0a0a758eef44f4b82.jpg\",\"flAchieved\":63.400001525878906,\"strID\":\"ACHIEVEMENT_86\"}],[\"ACHIEVEMENT_2\",{\"strName\":\"勇往直前\",\"strDescription\":\"完成任意 Horizon 賽事\",\"strImage\":\"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1551360/10d173cb881cf8fc9a354d8679e15b3778864ff9.jpg\",\"flAchieved\":79.80000305175781,\"strID\":\"ACHIEVEMENT_2\"}],[\"ACHIEVEMENT_3\",{\"strName\":\"高適應性\",\"strDescription\":\"完成逆境中的祈禱表演賽事\",\"strImage\":\"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/